<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Eletrobras 1996 net up 219 pct.</title>
<headline>Brazil Eletrobras 1996 net up 219 pct.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian state power utility holding Eletrobras has announced the following 1996 results.</p>
<p>			   1996		    1995</p>
<p>    Net		  2.393 bln	     750 million</p>
<p>    Shr profit	  44.53		    13.96</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Brazilian reais and according to Brazilian General Accounting Principles. Share profit figures provided in lots of 1,000 shares. Eletrobras said its annual profit increased 219 percent compared with 1995. ((--Simona de Logu, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 507 4151))</p>
</text>
